薊丘，故名。燕，因肩翻。薊，音計。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蓟，燕都也。班志，蓟县属广阳国。唐为幽州治所；今为燕京。水经注：蓟城西北隅有蓟丘，故名。燕，因肩翻。蓟，音计。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":275,"tongjian_id":"8cab28c3-db0e-11ef-b243-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8ca8d9cb-db0e-11ef-963a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhú","source_anchor_text":"晝邑人王蠋賢令軍中","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":8,"text":"蠋","tongjian_id":"8d2f751e-eddc-59e2-84ae-04eb18d154bd"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8ca8d9cb-db0e-11ef-963a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dòu","source_anchor_text":"枝自奮絕脰而死燕師","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":108,"text":"脰","tongjian_id":"9f21ab41-28b8-545f-88fb-6f2f99698ae8"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8ca8d9cb-db0e-11ef-963a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"juàn","source_anchor_text":"河濟屯阿鄄以連魏師","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":205,"text":"鄄","tongjian_id":"75f0a50b-a6d4-5239-951c-3d491b7ee11d"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"阿","place_note":"山東東阿","resolved_place_entity_id":1567,"start_index":203,"tongjian_id":"8cad5f4f-db0e-11ef-ae7a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/秦用他国人","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，辛、毅皆赵人也。楚悼王任吴起为相，诸侯患楚之强，盖卫人...","context_before":"...斯楚人。皆委国而听之不疑，卒之所以兼天下者，诸人之力也。","source_end_index":170,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6e15c2e4-f2d3-4bfd-b268-aaf88f22dfd7","source_start_index":153,"source_text":"燕昭王任郭隗、剧辛、乐毅，几灭强齐"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/秦用他国人","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/拔亡为存","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，赖田单之力，齐复为齐，尺寸之土无所失。曹操牧兖州，州叛...","context_before":"","source_end_index":23,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bec384b8-3cbb-4700-979c-de28237fab3d","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"燕乐毅伐齐，下七十余城，所存者唯莒、即墨两城耳"}],"path":"随笔/卷十三/拔亡为存","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/燕非强国","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。故苏秦说赵王曰：“赵北有燕，燕固弱国，不足畏也。”燕王...","context_before":"...见于中国者，不过三四，大率制命于齐。七雄之际，为齐所取，","source_end_index":69,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"736aac77-1802-441e-9402-8cea82e51826","source_start_index":41,"source_text":"后赖五国之力，乐毅为将，然后胜齐，然卒于得七十城不能守也"}],"path":"四笔/卷三/燕非强国","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"次则莫如元季之察罕。元至正中，山东为群盗田丰等所据，察罕...","context_before":"...，天下有事，未尝不起于山东。繇秦汉以迄宋元，可更仆数也。","source_end_index":596,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d003969e-77ca-5ce3-ac86-88a7fcf5331a","source_start_index":444,"source_text":"若其攻取大略，彪炳史册者，莫如乐毅，毅并护赵、楚、韩、魏之兵，为燕昭王伐齐，败齐兵于济，西分魏师，以略宋地，部赵师以收河间，身帅燕师，长驱逐北，遂入临淄。又遣左军渡胶东、东莱，前军循泰山，东至海，略琅邪，右军循河济，屯阿鄄以连魏师，后军并北海而抚千乘，以中军据临淄而镇齐都，六月之间，下齐七十余城，是也。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"黄歇说秦昭王，所谓割濮磨之北，绝齐、秦之要者[濮磨，徐广...","context_before":"州指挥相、魏，顾盼汴、宋，当走集之郊，为四战之地。","source_end_index":65,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9bd62a86-4b23-5b16-ad0a-e4b2df36d57b","source_start_index":25,"source_text":"战国时，乐毅伐齐，命左军循河屯阿、鄄之间[阿，谓东阿；鄄，即鄄城也]，以连魏师。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、青州府（卷三十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后汉耿弇攻张步，进军画中。章怀太子曰：即画邑也，以澅水而...","context_before":"画邑城[县西北二十里。齐邑也。孟子去齐，宿于画。","source_end_index":41,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"64a82e70-4fa2-54dc-8cdf-cd6a65a54855","source_start_index":24,"source_text":"又乐毅伐齐，闻画邑人王蠋贤，即此。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/五、青州府（卷三十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2樂毅聞晝邑人王蠋賢，令軍中環晝邑三十里無入。使人請蠋，蠋謝不往。燕人曰：「不來，吾且屠晝邑！」蠋曰：「忠臣不事二君，烈女不更二夫。國破君亡，吾不能存，而又欲劫之以兵；吾與其不義而生，不若死！」遂經其頸於樹枝，自奮絕脰而死。燕師乘勝長驅，齊城皆望風奔潰。樂毅修整燕軍，禁止侵掠，求齊之逸民，顯而禮之，寬其賦斂，除其暴令，修其舊政，齊民喜悅。乃遣左軍渡膠東、東萊；前軍循泰山以東至海，略琅邪；右軍循河、濟，屯阿、鄄以連魏師；後軍旁北海以撫千乘：中軍據臨淄而鎭齊都。祀桓公、管仲於郊，表賢者之閭，封王蠋之墓。齊人食邑於燕者二十餘君，有爵位於薊者百有餘人。六月之間，下齊七十餘城，皆爲郡縣。","content_fanyi":"乐毅听说昼邑人王蠋贤良，命令军中在昼邑周围三十里以内不得进入。派人去请王蠋，王蠋辞谢不去。燕国人说：“你不来，我们就要屠灭昼邑！”王蠋说：“忠臣不侍奉两个君主，烈女不嫁两个丈夫。如今国家破亡，君主丧命，我已不能保全国家，而你们又想用武力逼迫我；我与其不义地偷生，不如一死！”于是把脖颈套在树枝上，自己奋力一挣，勒断脖颈而死。燕国军队乘胜长驱直入，齐国各城邑民众都望风奔逃溃散。乐毅整饬燕军，禁止侵害抢掠百姓，寻访齐国隐逸的贤士，使他们显贵并礼遇他们，减轻赋税，废除暴虐的政令，恢复齐国原先宽松的政令，齐国百姓都很高兴。于是派遣左军渡过胶莱河抵达胶东、东莱；前军沿着泰山向东到达海边，攻取琅邪；右军沿着黄河、济水前进，屯驻在阿、鄄以联络魏军；后军沿着北海以安抚千乘；中军占据临淄，镇守齐国都城。乐毅又在郊外祭祀齐桓公、管仲，表彰贤者居住的里巷，增高王蠋的坟墓封土。齐国人中，在燕国享有封君食邑的有二十余位，在蓟都享有爵位的有一百余人。六个月之内，乐毅攻下齐国七十余座城邑，都设置为郡县。","content_jianti_auto":"2乐毅闻昼邑人王蠋贤，令军中环昼邑三十里无入。使人请蠋，蠋谢不往。燕人曰：「不来，吾且屠昼邑！」蠋曰：「忠臣不事二君，烈女不更二夫。国破君亡，吾不能存，而又欲劫之以兵；吾与其不义而生，不若死！」遂经其颈于树枝，自奋绝脰而死。燕师乘胜长驱，齐城皆望风奔溃。乐毅修整燕军，禁止侵掠，求齐之逸民，显而礼之，宽其赋敛，除其暴令，修其旧政，齐民喜悦。乃遣左军渡胶东、东莱；前军循泰山以东至海，略琅邪；右军循河、济，屯阿、鄄以连魏师；后军旁北海以抚千乘：中军据临淄而镇齐都。祀桓公、管仲于郊，表贤者之闾，封王蠋之墓。齐人食邑于燕者二十余君，有爵位于蓟者百有余人。六月之间，下齐七十余城，皆为郡县。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":345,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四 (周紀四) / 赧王中 / 三十一年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8ca8d9cb-db0e-11ef-963a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-284},"tongjian_id":"8ca8d9cb-db0e-11ef-963a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"阿","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d68685a-db0e-11ef-9342-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「數」作「四」；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「数」作「四」；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d686859-db0e-11ef-b4c1-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8d686858-db0e-11ef-8e84-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"三晋","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d68685d-db0e-11ef-80c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8d68685e-db0e-11ef-b995-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8d68685f-db0e-11ef-965f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨晉關","place_name_jianti_auto":"临晋关","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d686860-db0e-11ef-ac70-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"收三晉兵自河東攻秦則入臨晉關。","note_content_jianti_auto":"收三晋兵自河东攻秦则入临晋关。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"8d68685c-db0e-11ef-828a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊威王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐威王","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8d686862-db0e-11ef-b830-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"檀子","people_name_jianti_auto":"檀子","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8d686863-db0e-11ef-814e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"城南下，卽南城之下也。南城，齊威王使檀子所守者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"城南下，即南城之下也。南城，齐威王使檀子所守者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"8d686861-db0e-11ef-808a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d686865-db0e-11ef-b441-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8d686866-db0e-11ef-824a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d686867-db0e-11ef-b8da-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武關","place_name_jianti_auto":"武关","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8d686868-db0e-11ef-ab67-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"楚攻秦自南陽入武關。","note_content_jianti_auto":"楚攻秦自南阳入武关。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"8d686864-db0e-11ef-a130-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"阿","place_note":"山東东阿","resolved_place_entity_id":1567,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8d68686e-db0e-11ef-ab13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉置鄄城县，属济阴郡。鄄，读绢。后汉末，为兖州治，曹操创...","context_before":"...齐邑。威王八年，赵伐齐，取鄄。宣王八年，与魏惠王会于鄄。","source_end_index":165,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"554263ec-83aa-50fc-bcc0-ceabd91a8d1d","source_start_index":138,"source_text":"又王建末，即墨大夫谓三晋大夫不便秦而在阿、鄄之间者也。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦始皇二十八年，自南郡繇武关归。二世二年，陈涉使其将宋留...","context_before":"...至则闭，执之以归。顷襄王元年，秦出武关攻楚，取析十五城。","source_end_index":481,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e50d3daf-9bb4-555a-838d-7253c4f724ea","source_start_index":429,"source_text":"及秦并六国，东至齐，即墨大夫入见齐王曰：使鄢郢大夫收楚地，则武关可入；三晋大夫收晋地，则临晋之关可入也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"卽墨大夫聞之，見齊王曰：「齊地方數千里，帶甲數百萬。夫三晉大夫皆不便秦，而在阿、甄之間者百數；王收而與之百萬人之衆，使收三晉之故地，卽臨晉之關可以入矣。鄢郢大夫不欲爲秦，而在城南下者百數，王收而與之百萬之師，使收楚故地，卽武關可以入矣。如此，則齊威可立，秦國可亡，豈特保其國家而已哉！」齊王不聽。","content_fanyi":"即墨大夫听说后，进见齐王建说：“齐国疆域方圆数千里，甲士有数百万。如今韩、赵、魏三国的官员都不愿接受秦国的统治，流亡在阿城、甄城之间的有数百人；大王您把这些人收拢起来，拨给他们百万人的兵众，让他们去收复韩、赵、魏三国的旧地，那么就是秦国的临晋关也可以攻入了。楚国鄢郢的官员不愿受秦国驱使，逃匿在南城之下的有数百人；大王您把这些人召集起来，配给他们百万人的军队，让他们去收复楚国故土，那么即使是武关也可以攻入了。这样一来，齐国的声威可以树立，秦国可以被灭亡，难道仅仅只是保全自己的国家而已吗！”但齐王建不肯听从。","content_jianti_auto":"即墨大夫闻之，见齐王曰：「齐地方数千里，带甲数百万。夫三晋大夫皆不便秦，而在阿、甄之间者百数；王收而与之百万人之众，使收三晋之故地，即临晋之关可以入矣。鄢郢大夫不欲为秦，而在城南下者百数，王收而与之百万之师，使收楚故地，即武关可以入矣。如此，则齐威可立，秦国可亡，岂特保其国家而已哉！」齐王不听。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":549,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第七 (秦紀二) / 始皇帝下 / 二十五年 / 第 11 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8d686857-db0e-11ef-8135-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-222},"tongjian_id":"8d686857-db0e-11ef-8135-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"阿","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"陳平","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈平","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"967ef685-db0e-11ef-aa76-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"高帝","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"967ef686-db0e-11ef-855f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子產","people_name_jianti_auto":"子产","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"967ef687-db0e-11ef-b80c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晏子","people_name_jianti_auto":"晏子","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"967ef688-db0e-11ef-8c42-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景公","people_name_jianti_auto":"景公","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"967ef689-db0e-11ef-919b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晏子","people_name_jianti_auto":"晏子","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"967ef68a-db0e-11ef-a505-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景公","people_name_jianti_auto":"景公","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"967ef68b-db0e-11ef-b630-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晏子","people_name_jianti_auto":"晏子","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"967ef68c-db0e-11ef-bf34-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景公","people_name_jianti_auto":"景公","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"967ef68d-db0e-11ef-8601-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"967ef68e-db0e-11ef-9789-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"东阿","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"967ef68f-db0e-11ef-a342-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"东阿","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"967ef690-db0e-11ef-ba07-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陳平六出奇計以佐高帝。子產相鄭，擇能而使之，內無國中之亂，外無諸侯之患。說苑曰：晏子化東阿三年，景公召而數之。晏子請改道易行。明年上計，景公迎而賀之。晏子對曰：「臣前之化東阿也，屬託不行，貨賂不至，君反以罪臣；今則反是，而更蒙賀。」景公下席而謝。駮，北角翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"陈平六出奇计以佐高帝。子产相郑，择能而使之，内无国中之乱，外无诸侯之患。说苑曰：晏子化东阿三年，景公召而数之。晏子请改道易行。明年上计，景公迎而贺之。晏子对曰：「臣前之化东阿也，属托不行，货赂不至，君反以罪臣；今则反是，而更蒙贺。」景公下席而谢。駮，北角翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"967ef684-db0e-11ef-ac27-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"甘羅","people_name_jianti_auto":"甘罗","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"967ef693-db0e-11ef-8b96-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵王","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"967ef694-db0e-11ef-ab82-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"羅","people_name_jianti_auto":"罗","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"967ef695-db0e-11ef-b0ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子奇","people_name_jianti_auto":"子奇","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"967ef696-db0e-11ef-a766-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"終軍","people_name_jianti_auto":"终军","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"967ef697-db0e-11ef-8649-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南越王","people_name_jianti_auto":"南越王","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"967ef698-db0e-11ef-a510-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"967ef699-db0e-11ef-854c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賈誼","people_name_jianti_auto":"贾谊","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"967ef69a-db0e-11ef-ae37-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"967ef69b-db0e-11ef-958d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"967ef69c-db0e-11ef-a0c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"967ef69d-db0e-11ef-89b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"967ef69e-db0e-11ef-8382-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"967ef69f-db0e-11ef-9ed6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a0-db0e-11ef-a2e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a1-db0e-11ef-a80f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a2-db0e-11ef-8c06-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a3-db0e-11ef-bda5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"东阿","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a4-db0e-11ef-a042-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"东阿","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a5-db0e-11ef-bf0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"967ef6a6-db0e-11ef-abf5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記曰：秦欲與燕伐趙，以廣河間之地。甘羅年十二使於趙，趙王立割五城以廣河間；秦乃封羅爲上卿。說苑：子奇年十八，齊君使主東阿，東阿大化。前書：終軍年十八，自請願以長纓必羈南越王而致之闕下。武帝大悅，擢爲諫大夫。賈誼年十八，揚聲漢庭，文帝超遷之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记曰：秦欲与燕伐赵，以广河间之地。甘罗年十二使于赵，赵王立割五城以广河间；秦乃封罗为上卿。说苑：子奇年十八，齐君使主东阿，东阿大化。前书：终军年十八，自请愿以长缨必羁南越王而致之阙下。武帝大悦，擢为谏大夫。贾谊年十八，扬声汉庭，文帝超迁之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"967ef692-db0e-11ef-8941-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"967ef6ab-db0e-11ef-8273-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"回，轉也，反也。賢曰：剗，削也。戾，乖也。厭，滿也。剗，楚限翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"回，转也，反也。贤曰：刬，削也。戾，乖也。厌，满也。刬，楚限翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"967ef6aa-db0e-11ef-af9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"下，遐稼翻；下同。剝，與駮同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"下，遐稼翻；下同。剥，与駮同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"967ef6ac-db0e-11ef-a295-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"雄","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"967ef6ae-db0e-11ef-bec3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"雄","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"967ef6af-db0e-11ef-93f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"雄","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"967ef6b0-db0e-11ef-89b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言若附同雄言而駮議者異，則朝政爲不重；若與駮議者同而以雄言爲非，則上已從雄言而行之矣。朝，直遙翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言若附同雄言而駮议者异，则朝政为不重；若与駮议者同而以雄言为非，则上已从雄言而行之矣。朝，直遥翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"967ef6ad-db0e-11ef-876e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"衷，陟仲翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"衷，陟仲翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":182,"tongjian_id":"967ef6b1-db0e-11ef-a511-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"967ef683-db0e-11ef-afdf-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"chàn","source_anchor_text":"一臣之言剗戾舊章便","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":91,"text":"剗","tongjian_id":"c87caf42-82b2-5d92-8546-7e7382370e39"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"阿","resolved_place_entity_id":1567,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"967ef6b6-db0e-11ef-9142-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"胡廣、郭虔、史敞上書駮之曰：「凡選舉因才，無拘定制。六奇之策，不出經學；鄭、阿之政，非必章奏；甘、奇顯用，年乖強仕，終、賈揚聲，亦在弱冠。前世以來，貢舉之制，莫或回革。今以一臣之言，剗戾舊章，便利未明，衆心不厭。矯枉變常，政之所重，而不訪台司，不謀卿士；若事下之後，議者剝異，異之則朝失其便，同之則王言已行。臣愚以爲可宣下百官，參其同異，然後覽擇勝否，詳采厥衷。」帝不從。","content_fanyi":"胡广、郭虔、史敞上书驳斥左雄说：“凡是选拔举荐人才都应根据才能，不应拘泥于固定制度。陈平六出奇计，并不是出自经学；子产治理郑国、晏子治理东阿的政事，并不一定依靠章奏公文；甘罗、子奇受到重用时，年龄离四十岁还远；终军、贾谊声名显扬，也都在二十岁左右。自从前代以来，贡举制度没有谁更改过。现在因为一个臣子的建议，就背离旧有典章，好处尚未显现，众人心中不服。纠正偏差和变革常规，是政务中的大事，却不咨询三公等官府，也不与公卿大臣商议；如果将左雄的建言下交群臣，议论的人一定会提出不同意见；无视这些不同意见，朝廷在执行上便会失去便利和威望；赞同这些不同意见，又等于否定已经颁行的王言。臣愚昧地认为，可以将此事宣示百官，比较各种意见的异同，然后考察选择优劣可否，详细采纳其中的恰当意见。”汉顺帝不接受。","content_jianti_auto":"胡广、郭虔、史敞上书駮之曰：「凡选举因才，无拘定制。六奇之策，不出经学；郑、阿之政，非必章奏；甘、奇显用，年乖强仕，终、贾扬声，亦在弱冠。前世以来，贡举之制，莫或回革。今以一臣之言，刬戾旧章，便利未明，众心不厌。矫枉变常，政之所重，而不访台司，不谋卿士；若事下之后，议者剥异，异之则朝失其便，同之则王言已行。臣愚以为可宣下百官，参其同异，然后览择胜否，详采厥衷。」帝不从。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4323,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十一 (漢紀四十三) / 孝順皇帝上 / 陽嘉元年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"967ef683-db0e-11ef-afdf-a0d3651f611f","year_int":132},"tongjian_id":"967ef683-db0e-11ef-afdf-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":5},"place_name":"阿"},"message":"success","success":true}